X42QMBIjFqoHTH3SrYZvZMOwQ8WLTH2crSiaY9w3A&oe=6A99775D"}, "display_name": "Pandora", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Open the box and gain the powers that reside within. Open the box and interrupt their slumber ... if you dare.\n\nPandora is a retro-style arcade shooter infused with the haptics and the scale of VR. Face hordes of demons and beat your highscores - or try your luck in various short but demanding challenge scenarios. Let them drown in a barrage of magic, manipulate time and collect crystals for upgrades and to unleash your most powerful attacks! \n\nUse headphones for better experience.", "short_description": "Open the box and gain the powers that reside within. Open the box and interrupt their slumber ... if you dare.\n\nPandora is a retro-style arcade shooter infused with the haptics and the scale of VR. Face hordes of demons and beat your highscores - or try your luck in various short but demanding challenge scenarios. Let them drown in a barrage of magic, manipulate time and collect crystals for upgrades and to unleash your most powerful attacks! "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sucurema.com/en/privacy-policy-pandora-vr", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sucurema GmbH", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sucurema.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "SHOOTER", "ACTION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCAL